  "gh:content": {
    "en": "The false god steals the grace of silence. I lay a ‘breath of relation’ across the field and give a cue to replace fear. The Ogre’s armor loosens a little at the chest.\nNei-chan: “Hold ASC. Tama, you can go.”\nI tap a small kagura. Signal. I raise the resolution of naming one notch: “Whose breathing does your ‘order’ stop?”",
    "ja": "偽神は沈黙の恩恵を奪い取る。私は『関係の呼吸』を場に敷設し、恐れに代わる合図を与える。Compliance Ogreの鎧が、胸元から少しだけ緩む。\nNei-chan「ASC、維持。タマ、行ける」\n私は小さく神楽を一拍。合図。名づけの解像度を一段上げる。「あなたの“秩序”は、誰の呼吸を止めてる？」"
  },
  "gh:index": 5
}